Accept, store and broadcast native harness subscription usage windows.

external_session_usage accepts data.rate_limits ({"windows": [{"window_minutes",
"used_percent", "resets_at"}]}, at most two windows), stores it in the
omnigent.rate_limits session label for page loads, and adds it to the
session.usage SSE event. A rate-limits-only post skips the cost roll-up.
Applies after 0001-sandbox-model-catalog-fallback.patch. Base: omnigent v0.15.0
(c8b9b85f822f).

